<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Highwoods started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Highwoods started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst David Sherman has started coverage of Highwoods Properties Inc with a rating of outperform, a source at the brokerage said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Sherman was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Raleigh, N.C., company closed on Wednesday at 34.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
